@host = http://localhost:5266

### Registrar usuário

POST {{host}}/api/auth/registrar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Maria",
  "email": "maria@teste.com",
  "senha": "senha1234"
}

### Login

POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria@teste.com",
  "senha": "senha1234"
}

### Criar casamento
POST http://localhost:5266/api/casamento
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..6kuz1LZI6ADi63vyedTJalxWoX7_2UiINZUc8oHc8aE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nomeNoivo1": "Maria",
  "nomeNoivo2": "João",
  "dataPrevista": "2027-06-12",
  "cidade": "Blumenau",
  "orcamentoTotal": 0
}

### Ver casamento
GET http://localhost:5266/api/casamento
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..6kuz1LZI6ADi63vyedTJalxWoX7_2UiINZUc8oHc8aE